  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"news-container\" class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div id=\"about-top-title\">技術問答</div>\n\n<div class=\"container page_spacing lang_rtl\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n    \t<div class=\"col-md-1\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-10 block-bg-01\">\n\n            <h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line\">認證</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-01.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-08.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康壓力桶是否標示”CE”?</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_1\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_1\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>是的，溢康壓力桶符合歐洲 PED指令 2014/68 / EU（壓力設備指令）和符合 EN 13831。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-08.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">什麼是NSF61?</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_4\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_4\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>一般來說，這個標準主要檢測壓力桶及其各個零配件材料的有毒物質,及解析到水中的有毒物質是否符合飲用水及食品安全標準。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-08.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">產品是否能提供完整的材料履歷與認證文件（如 NSF, CE, WRAS）？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_17\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_17\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t<li bullet_list=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"2 4 [\">\r\n\t<p>產品符合 NSF/ANSI 58, 61, 372, CE, ACS, KC, WaterMark, UPC 等主要認證。</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>所有接觸水的零件材料均符合歐盟 RoHS、REACH、PFAS 及 TSCA 要求。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>每一件產品均在 ISO 9001 品質管理系統下製造，確保材料與製程具備完整可追溯性。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-08.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康在 ESG（環境、社會、公司治理）方面有哪些實踐？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_18\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_18\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t<li data-pm-slice=\"2 4 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{}]\">\r\n\t<p><strong>環境：</strong> 通過 ISO 14064-1:2018 碳盤查與溫室氣體認證；使用環保三層塗層。</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>社會：</strong> 每日追蹤意外率，視員工安全為首要；嚴格禁止童工與強迫勞動。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>治理：</strong> 營運透明、財務穩定，具備 ISO 9001 品質保證體系。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-08.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">AQUASKY 是一家製造商還是貿易商？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_19\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_19\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">溢康（AQUASKY）是位於台灣台中的 100% 製造商。所有核心製程（焊接、塗裝、壓力測試、組裝、包裝）均在廠內完成，產品完全符合全球認證標準。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line\">產品</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-02.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康隔膜壓力桶適合飲用水使用嗎？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_2\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_2\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>可以，溢康隔膜壓力桶可用於衛生飲用水系統。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康壓力桶的最大工作壓力是多少？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_5\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_5\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" class=\"table\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>壓力桶</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Bar</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>PSI</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>RO逆滲透儲水桶</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.0</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>100</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>泵浦壓力桶</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10 / 16 / 25</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>150/ 230 / 360</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>熱膨脹罐</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>150</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>導熱液體膨脹罐</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>150</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康壓力桶的最高工作溫度是多少？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_6\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_6\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" class=\"table\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>壓力桶</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>&deg;C</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>&deg;F</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>RO逆滲透儲水桶</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>90</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>194</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>泵浦壓力桶</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>90</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>194</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>熱膨脹罐</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>90</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>194</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>導熱液體膨脹罐</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>120</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>250</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康壓力桶的保固期是多久？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_7\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_7\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>溢康保固期因市場而異。 請聯繫您當地的經銷商以獲得適用於您所在地區的保固。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">請詳細說明你們在 OEM/ODM 專案中的研發與設計能力。</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_20\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_20\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t<li data-pm-slice=\"2 4 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{}]\">\r\n\t<p><strong>3D 建模與壓力模擬：</strong> 利用全 3D CAD 設計與內部壓力模擬，確保結構完整性。</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>快速原型製作：</strong> 數週內即可將概念轉化為功能性原型，縮短產品上市時間。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>高度彈性：</strong> 提供尺寸、塗裝顏色與接頭規格的客製化選項。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康擁有哪些關鍵的製造技術或獨家專利？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_21\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_21\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t<li data-pm-slice=\"2 4 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{}]\">\r\n\t<p><strong>卓越焊接技術：</strong> 符合 ASME VIII 與 EN 13831 標準。</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>100% 氮氣預充填：</strong> 減少壓力流失，維持長期穩定效能。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>專利 Leak-Safe 接頭：</strong> 提供防腐蝕且防洩漏的系統連接。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p><strong>高性能塗層：</strong> 多層環氧樹脂塗層可耐極端環境。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-09.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">你們的最小訂購量 (MOQ) 政策是什麼？是否接受混合型號的訂單？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_22\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_22\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">標準顏色（藍色、米色）無 MOQ 要求。客製化顏色 MOQ 為每批 400 件。我們接受同一個貨櫃中混合不同型號的訂單。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line2\">建議</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-03.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-10.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康壓力桶的預充壓力可以修改嗎？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_8\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_8\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>可以，謹慎修改溢康壓力桶的預充壓力。我們建議請專業人員進行操作。了解必須或已安裝容器的系統或工廠的具體特徵，<br />\r\n溢康壓力桶的預充壓力可以增加到最大 3.5 bar，也可以減少到最小 0.5 bar。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-10.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">如何選擇溢康壓力桶尺寸以及需要哪些訊息？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_9\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_9\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>根據使用類型（用於鍋爐、供暖系統、家用熱水系統、熱水和冷水系統），可以通過&rdquo;溢康壓力桶選擇工具&rdquo;計算出來您適合的壓力桶尺寸。<br />\r\n如需更多信息，請聯繫我們的技術部門。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line2\">壓力</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-04.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-11.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">壓力開關是如何控制泵和壓力桶的？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_10\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_10\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>壓力開關是泵和壓力桶之間的協調器。 壓力開關監測桶內的壓力。 因此，當切入和切出壓力分別達到桶內設定值時，會自動打開或關閉泵。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-11.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">什麼是常見的切入和切出值？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_11\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_11\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>通常，泵根據預先設定的壓力設置啟動和停止。 我們的壓力桶的縮減功能具有 30/50 的壓力設置。 這意味著泵在壓力桶 psi 為 30 psi 時啟動（切入）並在 50psi 時停止（切出）。 從 20psi 開始，切入和切出之間通常存在 20psi 的差異。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-11.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">壓力桶通常的預充壓力是多少？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_12\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_12\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>壓力桶的預充量取決於許多因素。 首先，什麼類型的壓力桶（一般來說，純加熱或飲用水使用）和壓力桶有多大。 所有溢康壓力桶都在工廠進行預充壓力和測試。 預充壓力應比泵的啟動壓力低 2psi。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-11.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">你們的品質管制流程中，針對壓力循環測試的標準是什麼？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_23\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_23\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">所有壓力罐均符合 NSF/ANSI 61 與歐盟 PED 標準。測試標準為進行 100,000 次連續壓力循環測試，模擬真實運作環境。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line2\">安裝</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-05.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-12.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">如何安裝、維修和保養溢康壓力桶？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_13\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_13\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>關於溢康壓力桶的安裝、服務和維護，請參考使用說明書。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-12.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">你們如何處理客製化需求以及與客戶現有系統的技術整合問題？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_24\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_24\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t<li data-pm-slice=\"2 4 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{}]\">\r\n\t<p>提供混合型號樣本供測試。</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>工程團隊會針對客戶系統的容量、接頭與壓力範圍進行聯合開發。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>提供詳細技術圖紙與模擬數據。</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line2\">品質</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-06.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-13.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">為什麼要使用隔膜壓力桶？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_14\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_14\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>隔膜壓力桶可以使系統中的氮氣氣墊與系統水分開，防止水洩漏。因為氮氣在桶壁和隔膜外部之間，系統水在另一側。溢康壓力桶的外殼採用經過環氧粉末塗層，此外，這一系列的壓力桶也獲得了NSF 61認證。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-13.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">為什麼要使用氮氣？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_15\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_15\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>相較於氧氣，氮氣通過隔膜橡膠的機率較小，這意味著壓力桶在使用時不需要重新加壓空氣壓力。氮氣對溫度變化非常穩定，這意味著在使用壽命期間充氣壓力更加一致。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"news-h2 news-line\">解決方案</h2>\n<div class=\"row page_spacing-3\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-07.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-9\">\n    \t    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">如何檢查壓力桶的內部隔膜是否破裂？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_3\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_3\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>所有溢康隔膜壓力桶都經由氣閥預裝了氮氣。桶內的橡膠隔膜保持水與氮氣分離。因此，一旦發生故障,檢查桶內的隔膜是否破裂，您必須採取方法:用工具(例如螺絲起子)按壓氣閥，，然後檢查什麼原因。 如果漏水，這意味著隔膜破裂，水完全充滿了容器。 然而，如果空氣排出，隔膜應該仍然完好無損,並且有必要再次對壓力桶進行預充讓它起作用。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">如何避免壓力桶損壞和故障並確保安裝產品的使用壽命？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_16\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_16\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>為避免破損和故障，請先查閱壓力桶上貼黏的技術標籤和製造商提供的使用說明書。 此外，有必要：<br />\r\n● 正確安裝和定期維護<br />\r\n● 定期檢查壓力桶的預充壓力，必要時將其恢復到標籤上指示的值<br />\r\n● 檢查系統是否正確接地，以避免電流<br />\r\n● 檢查壓力桶容積是否正確<br />\r\n● 注意系統超壓過大和水錘現象<br />\r\n● 避免將壓力桶安裝在不適宜的環境或氣候條件特別惡劣的地區<br />\r\n● 避免形成導致腐蝕現象發展的冷凝水<br />\r\n● 監測含有乙二醇或其他物質的溶液的 pH 值<br />\r\n● 避免混合使用不同的防凍產品</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">為什麼我們應該選擇溢康作為長期戰略合作夥伴？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_25\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_25\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">溢康擁有超過 30 年產業經驗，銷售 50 多國。我們結合高品質生產、彈性 OEM/ODM 能力，以及穩定的定價與交期。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">溢康的公司願景與未來五年的發展藍圖是什麼？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_26\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_26\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">願景是成為全球最受信賴的壓力罐與水系統製造商。五年藍圖包括投資智慧製造、擴張新市場、開發環保產品並深化 ESG 實踐。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">作為台灣製造商，溢康如何確保全球供應鏈的穩定性與韌性？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_27\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_27\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">多港口出貨彈性、多元化原料採購策略，並在美歐等重要區域設有經銷夥伴安全庫存。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">成為溢康經銷商的條件、定價結構與付款條件為何？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_28\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_28\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">最小起訂量為一個 20 呎櫃（可混榜），以 FOB 台中計價。付款條件首單 100% T/T，後續訂單 50% 定金、50% 出貨前付清。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    \t<div class=\"news-title\">\n\n        \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-2 col-md-2\"><img src=\"/images/FAQ/FAQ-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-10 col-md-10\">保固條款與售後服務的具體內容是什麼？</div>\n                </div>\n\n        </div>\n    \t<div id=\"collapse_qa_29\" aria-labelledby=\"qa_head_id_29\" >\n        \t<div class=\"news-content\">\n\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;bullet_list&quot;,{},&quot;list_item&quot;,{}]\">RO 罐 3 年保固；其餘多數罐體 5 年保固。僅限製造缺陷，需提供證據，批准後將以產品更換方式於下一張訂單補足。</p>            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-1\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>"
}
